  "title": "Swiss Chard with Garbanzo Beans and Fresh Tomatoes",
  "description": "Beans and greens are a perfect combination; earthy and satisfying. This recipe for Swiss chard with garbanzo beans, onion, and fresh tomato is brightened with lemon juice and makes a perfect vegetarian main dish or a tantalizing side dish for fish or meat.",
